  <!-- GetSearchPath/SetSearchPath were hidden in the mono era, when they took
       Gtk 3's (char ***, int *) and IconTheme.cs bound them by hand. Gtk 4 gives
       them the same strv shape as the resource path, and with them hidden
       PropertyBase.Getter found nothing, so the "search-path" GObject property
       was emitted through GetProperty/SetProperty instead, as a *string*,
       because that is what SymbolTable makes of const-gchar** with no array
       rule. The value holds a G_TYPE_STRV, so the getter read null and the
       setter asked GObject to transform a string into a strv and was refused.
       Unhidden, the method pair forms the property, exactly as ResourcePath
       right beside it already did. -->
